**scrubber**, switch to cleaner coal, **purchase** permits, or sell a **surplus**; unused units could be **banked**. This **flexibility** let firms choose among **alternatives**, but not enlarge the **quota**: every emitted ton still consumed an allowance.",
      "zh": "法律把这份排放**预算**(budget)拆成可以交易的**排放额度**(allowances)，每一份都**允许**(authorising)排放一吨二氧化硫。电厂可以安装**洗涤器**(scrubber)、改用更清洁的煤、**购买**(purchase)额度，或出售**剩余额度**(surplus)；暂时不用的额度还可**存留到以后**(banked)。这种**灵活性**(flexibility)让企业在不同**方案**(alternatives)之间选择，却不能扩大总**配额**(quota)：每排放一吨，仍须消耗一份额度。"
    },
    {
